      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a new high fantasy novel and I'm stuck on the villains. I want to create an antagonist group that feels really different from my main characters. My protagonists are part of this highly civilized, enlightened, and structured empire, so I want the villains to be a total contrast. Can you help me brainstorm some ideas for a group that is more dark, exotic, and threatening? I want their culture to feel really primitive and untamed compared to the empire. Maybe give me some ideas for their look and how they behave?",
